# GitHub language stats (github-linguist)
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md

# Embedded H5 tools bundled into the macOS app — not the primary language.
Tool/** linguist-vendored

# Marketing / docs site — exclude from code language breakdown.
Website/** linguist-documentation

# Large localization catalog skews JSON stats.
Resources/Localizable.xcstrings linguist-generated
Resources/InfoPlist.xcstrings linguist-generated
